{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o137c","title":"扩魏郡辖县","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o137c-account","label":"正文","text":"划河内、东郡、巨鹿、赵的若干县增益魏郡。","evidence":["wudi-e-o137c-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":{"text":"魏郡","evidence":["wudi-e-o137c-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十七年","year":212,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o137c-q","wudi-q-o137","wudi-q-b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940"],"chronology":"wudi-y212","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o137","basis":"建安十七年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,781,"O137c"],"order":327}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o137c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4c8ba9bf8d7f6ff8015","layer":"original","quote":"割河内之荡阴、朝歌、林虑〖7〗，东郡之卫国、顿丘、东武阳、发干〖8〗，巨鹿之廮陶、曲周、南和、广平、（之）任（城）〖9〗，赵之襄国、邯郸、易阳，以益魏郡〖10〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-32846c231ed2b04de76f","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o137","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4c8ba9bf8d7f6ff8015","layer":"original","quote":"十七年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。天子命公赞拜不名〖2〗，入朝不趋〖3〗，剑履上殿〖4〗：如萧何故事〖5〗。马超余众梁兴等，屯蓝田〖6〗，使夏侯渊击平之。割河内之荡阴、朝歌、林虑〖7〗，东郡之卫国、顿丘、东武阳、发干〖8〗，巨鹿之廮陶、曲周、南和、广平、（之）任（城）〖9〗，赵之襄国、邯郸、易阳，以益魏郡〖10〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a63575780